  "summary": "Tycoon 2FA is a Phishing-as-a-Service AiTM kit (attributed to Storm-1747) that reverse-proxies Entra ID and Google Workspace login flows to steal post-MFA session tokens, using cheap cloud-VPS relay IPs with Node.js HTTP clients and a residential-proxy operator console. Detection anchors include Node.js user agents (node, axios, undici) on Auth Broker/OfficeHome sign-ins, device-registration abuse for primaryRefreshToken persistence, and rapid multi-category Microsoft Graph reconnaissance from the same user within minutes of token issuance.",
  "mitre_techniques": [
